	(text "System-5 front panel Rev A, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Displays       THE BUS ADDRESS AND THE OUTPUT PORT: SIX TIL311S AND EIGHT LEDS\n  sheet 3  Controls       DATA TOGGLES, INPUT, RUN AND LOAD, AND THE RESET BUTTON'S BOOT RESET\n  sheet 4  Status         SIX STATUS LEDS, AND THE COPY OF THE CPU CARD'S LOADED FLAG\n  sheet 5  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, MOUNTING HOLES\n\nRedrawn from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5177018-b53b-5c20-8c91-c9e695e86466"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
	(embedded_fonts no)
